Subject: [PATCH 2453/3799] soh: rename func_80A01C38 -> EnElf_SetMotionMode

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: stores a mode id and loads that mode's orbit rates, radii, timer and motion function
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Elf/z_en_elf.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Elf/z_en_elf.c | 19 ++++++++++---------
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Elf/z_en_elf.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Elf/z_en_elf.c
